WEBVTT

00:11:01.106 --> 00:11:02.806
It was like Narnia.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:06.308
(Laughter)

00:11:06.332 --> 00:11:07.978
And then we went into his kitchen.

00:11:08.772 --> 00:11:12.924
Now, Al Dunlap would be brought in
to save failing companies,

00:11:12.948 --> 00:11:15.371
he'd close down 30 percent
of the workforce.

00:11:15.395 --> 00:11:18.574
And he'd quite often
fire people with a joke.

00:11:18.598 --> 00:11:20.943
Like, for instance,
one famous story about him,

00:11:20.967 --> 00:11:24.419
somebody came up to him and said,
"I've just bought myself a new car."

00:11:24.443 --> 00:11:26.451
And he said, "Well,
you may have a new car,

00:11:26.475 --> 00:11:29.980
but I'll tell you what you
don't have -- a job."